DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13949::$$$message_0111_0000_0000$$$::A day goes by.[lr]::
13950::$$$message_0111_0000_0001$$$::It was only an hour or so for us, but the sun has gone around once.::
13951::$$$message_0111_0001_0000$$$::"...Hey. I'm a little tired."[lr]::
13952::$$$message_0111_0001_0001$$$::"...Yeah. I'm a little tired, too."[lr]::
13953::$$$message_0111_0001_0002$$$::We talk without making eye contact.[lr]::
13954::$$$message_0111_0001_0003$$$::There's an oppressive feeling from being trapped in the box, but my embarrassment of being super close to Tohsaka is more overpowering.::
13955::$$$message_0111_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13956::$$$message_0111_0002_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
13957::$$$message_0111_0002_0002$$$::Um, I feel like I want to stay like this forever, but being confined isn't good for my mind and body.[lr]::
13958::$$$message_0111_0002_0003$$$::We need to seriously find a way out soon[line len=3]::
13959::$$$message_0111_0003_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Yeah. We can't stay like this forever.[lr]::
13960::$$$message_0111_0003_0001$$$::We need to act on our own instead of waiting for help."[lr]::
13961::$$$message_0111_0003_0002$$$::"...Tohsaka."[lr]::
13962::$$$message_0111_0003_0003$$$::Tohsaka was faster to rise to action than my determination.[lr]::
13963::$$$message_0111_0003_0004$$$::I don't know what her motive is, but she seems to be more fired up than me.::
13964::$$$message_0111_0004_0000$$$::"Look, it's a box full of mysteries, but one thing that's for certain is that the lid and the outside are physically connected. This is a simple yet absolute law.[lr]::
13965::$$$message_0111_0004_0001$$$::Then[line len=3]"[lr]::
13966::$$$message_0111_0004_0002$$$::"...You're saying we should use brute force before thinking too hard, huh?[lr]::
13967::$$$message_0111_0004_0003$$$::Yeah, we should just push the lid open together since the lid is right above us."::
13968::$$$message_0111_0005_0000$$$::We act immediately once that's decided.[lr]::
13969::$$$message_0111_0005_0001$$$::Like checking the elasticity of a cushion, [se storage=se041.wav]I put my hand against the inner lid.::
13970::$$$message_0111_0006_0000$$$::"One, two..."[lr]::
13971::$$$message_0111_0006_0001$$$::"Three!"[rf]::
13972::$$$message_0111_0007_0000$$$::We try to extend our bodies[line len=3]and[line len=3][lr]::
13973::$$$message_0111_0007_0001$$$::Dammit, it's not budging...!::
13974::$$$message_0111_0008_0000$$$::"...As expected of my grandmaster's treasure box."[lr]::
13975::$$$message_0111_0008_0001$$$::"Don't be impressed, Tohsaka[line len=3]oh yeah!"[lr]::
13976::$$$message_0111_0008_0002$$$::I grab the cane from earlier.[lr]::
13977::$$$message_0111_0008_0003$$$::If I shove this into the small opening of the lid and use it as a lever to push up[line len=3]::
13978::$$$message_0111_0009_0000$$$::"...Forget about the cane, Shirou."[lr]::
13979::$$$message_0111_0009_0001$$$::"Oof... Then!"::
13980::$$$message_0111_0010_0000$$$::I flip upside [se storage=se288.wav]down in the treasure box.[lr]::
13981::$$$message_0111_0010_0001$$$::If using my arms doesn't work, then using my legs will give three times more power, and using my back will give five times more power![lr]::
13982::$$$message_0111_0010_0002$$$::If that doesn't work, then I'll Strengthen my legs and double the power![lr]::
13983::$$$message_0111_0010_0003$$$::But, before that...::
13984::$$$message_0111_0011_0000$$$::"W-Where are you touching, what are you, ah!"[lr]::
13985::$$$message_0111_0011_0001$$$::An absurd attack is added.[lr]::
13986::$$$message_0111_0011_0002$$$::When I tried to change my position, [se storage=se226.wav]my arm touched Tohsaka's chest,[se volume=50 storage=se163.wav] my head touched her thigh,[lr]::
13987::$$$message_0111_0011_0003$$$::and just from getting into a position like I'm peeking from below, ouch!::
13988::$$$message_0111_0012_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, lift up your legs too[line len=3]"[wvs][se storage=se528.wav][lr]::
13989::$$$message_0111_0012_0001$$$::"AS IF!!![lr]::
13990::$$$message_0111_0012_0002$$$::[se storage=se122.wav]What, you pervert! [wvl][se storage=se230.wav]Blockhead! [wvl][se storage=se229.wav]Scarecrow![wvl][se storage=se265.wav] Stupid apron!"::
13991::$$$message_0111_0013_0000$$$::The latter half turns into [se storage=se149.wav]swearing that doesn't make any sense.[se storage=se123.wav][lr]::
13992::$$$message_0111_0013_0001$$$::Guh, her attacks [se storage=se151.wav]are becoming more and more accurate, and I start tasting iron [se storage=se528.wav]in the back of my nose like she's aiming for a KO...!::
13993::$$$message_0111_0014_0000$$$::"Got it, so stop, I said I'll stop so stop!"[lr]::
13994::$$$message_0111_0014_0001$$$::[se storage=se065.wav]I go back to my original position. [se volume=50 storage=se075.wav][lr]::
13995::$$$message_0111_0014_0002$$$::[se storage=se205.wav]If I'm going to keep getting punched by Tohsaka like this, [se storage=se231.wav]I feel like the only thing that'll be escaping is my spirit from my body.::
13996::$$$message_0111_0015_0000$$$::Tohsaka starts to breathe heavily like a cat.[lr]::
13997::$$$message_0111_0015_0001$$$::...I'm troubled. Even her breathing starts to feel hot when I'm next to her.::
13998::$$$message_0111_0016_0000$$$::"...You used all that chaos as a chance to feel me up."[lr]::
13999::$$$message_0111_0016_0001$$$::"I didn't have any ill intentions, so forgive me... Tohsaka, are these your glasses?"[lr]::
14000::$$$message_0111_0016_0002$$$::We caused that much of a ruckus, so it's natural that they came off.[lr]::
14001::$$$message_0111_0016_0003$$$::As an apology, I try to pick them up[line len=3]::
14002::$$$message_0111_0017_0000$$$::"Here... Huh?"[lr]::
14003::$$$message_0111_0017_0001$$$::Something smooth and made out of resin.[lr]::
14004::$$$message_0111_0017_0002$$$::When I bend my fingers to open it up, a liquid crystal light illuminates the inside of the box[line len=3]::
14005::$$$message_0111_0018_0000$$$::"There's a cell phone here."[lr]::
14006::$$$message_0111_0018_0001$$$::"..."::
14007::$$$message_0111_0019_0000$$$::"Isn't it yours, Tohsaka?[lr]::
14008::$$$message_0111_0019_0001$$$::You could've called for help with this earlier."[lr]::
14009::$$$message_0111_0019_0002$$$::"...I suppose so."[lr]::
14010::$$$message_0111_0019_0003$$$::Tohsaka takes it and fiddles with the screen of the phone[line len=3]::
14011::$$$message_0111_0020_0000$$$::"You call."[lr]::
14012::$$$message_0111_0020_0001$$$::"Huh? Isn't something like that bad?"[lr]::
14013::$$$message_0111_0020_0002$$$::I don't know what's in a girl's phone, and it would be bad manners to look at her contacts.::
14014::$$$message_0111_0021_0000$$$::"It's fine. It's your fault that it turned out like this, so you're going to do something about it."[lr]::
14015::$$$message_0111_0021_0001$$$::"Okay, I'll do it."[lr]::
14016::$$$message_0111_0021_0002$$$::Fearing that it might be filled with guys' names, [se storage=se261.wav]I nervously open her contacts.::
14017::$$$message_0111_0022_0000$$$::But, there are no guys or girls or groups.[lr]::
14018::$$$message_0111_0022_0001$$$::There's not a single phone number in her contacts.[lr]::
14019::$$$message_0111_0022_0002$$$::"..."::
14020::$$$message_0111_0023_0000$$$::"Could it be that...you don't know how to use it?"[lr]::
14021::$$$message_0111_0023_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14022::$$$message_0111_0023_0002$$$::It seems like I was spot on. Therefore, I can't pursue it any further.[lr]::
14023::$$$message_0111_0023_0003$$$::That's so like Tohsaka... I'm surprised the battery lasted.::
14024::$$$message_0111_0024_0000$$$::"Umm... Calling the police wouldn't be good, right?"[lr]::
14025::$$$message_0111_0024_0001$$$::It's not good to let the public authority inside a mage's workshop.[lr]::
14026::$$$message_0111_0024_0002$$$::In that case, I should call Mitsuzuri's cell phone since she's on her way... Wait, I don't know her phone number.::
14027::$$$message_0111_0025_0000$$$::I try to recall phone numbers... My house, Fuji-nee's Fujimura Group, all that's left are Homurahara, Ryudou Temple, and the Matou house... No, I shouldn't call Homurahara or Ryudou Temple.[lr]::
14028::$$$message_0111_0025_0001$$$::I should only get help from other mages.::
14029::$$$message_0111_0026_0000$$$::"I wonder if we'll get a signal.[lr]::
14030::$$$message_0111_0026_0001$$$::I'm going to call my home first, that's safest."[lr]::
14031::$$$message_0111_0026_0002$$$::Saber, Rider, [fadebgm time=1000 volume=40][seloop storage=se537.wav]Sakura, any of them would be able to guess the situation.::
14032::$$$message_0111_0027_0000$$$::"Hello? You've reached the Emiya household."[lr]::
14033::$$$message_0111_0027_0001$$$::"Fuji-nee?"[lr]::
14034::$$$message_0111_0027_0002$$$::However, the one who answered was Fuji-nee who was the hardest one to explain the situation to.::
14035::$$$message_0111_0028_0000$$$::"Oh, what's wrong, Shirou?"[lr]::
14036::$$$message_0111_0028_0001$$$::"Is Saber or Sakura at home right now?"[lr]::
14037::$$$message_0111_0028_0002$$$::"Saber's out right now. So are Rider and Sakura."[lr]::
14038::$$$message_0111_0028_0003$$$::"Oh... Illya isn't there either, right?"::
14039::$$$message_0111_0029_0000$$$::"I don't see Illya either.[lr]::
14040::$$$message_0111_0029_0001$$$::So, what's up?"[lr]::
14041::$$$message_0111_0029_0002$$$::"...Mrgh."[lr]::
14042::$$$message_0111_0029_0003$$$::...The phone's battery isn't infinite either.[lr]::
14043::$$$message_0111_0029_0004$$$::I don't know when it's going to die, so I have to somehow get help from Fuji-nee.::
14044::$$$message_0111_0030_0000$$$::"Umm, listen calmly, Fuji-nee."[lr]::
14045::$$$message_0111_0030_0001$$$::"Huh? About lunch?"[lr]::
14046::$$$message_0111_0030_0002$$$::"I'm in a bit of a pickle at Tohsaka's house and... Hello?"[lr]::
14047::$$$message_0111_0030_0003$$$::Dammit, is the reception bad? It doesn't connect when it's most important.::
14048::$$$message_0111_0031_0000$$$::"Hello!? I'm in trouble, so can you come help... Fuji-nee? Hello?"[lr]::
14049::$$$message_0111_0031_0001$$$::"Wait, are you with Tohsaka? Hey, what are you saying, Shirou!? You said you were traveling to Europe by yourself!"[lr]::
14050::$$$message_0111_0031_0002$$$::"What?"[lr]::
14051::$$$message_0111_0031_0003$$$::[font italic=true]What is Fuji-nee saying?[font italic=false]::
14052::$$$message_0111_0032_0000$$$::"Ugh, I said you can't do those kinds of things![lr]::
14053::$$$message_0111_0032_0001$$$::It's too early to go traveling overseas with just the two of you![lr]::
14054::$$$message_0111_0032_0002$$$::Even if you act pure and proper, I always tell you time and time again that you can't do those kinds of things with a girl!"[wm canskip=0][lr]::
14055::$$$message_0111_0032_0003$$$::"W-What are you saying!?[lr]::
14056::$$$message_0111_0032_0004$$$::I said to stay calm... [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01a][wvl canskip=0 time=500][sestop storage=se669.wav time=100 nowait=1][se storage=se047.wav][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01a]Wait, ahhh!"::
14057::$$$message_0111_0033_0000$$$::[line len=3]She hung up.[lr]::
14058::$$$message_0111_0033_0001$$$::Before I could tell her to come help us...and without ever being able to comprehend it.::
14059::$$$message_0111_0034_0000$$$::"Calling home didn't work.[lr]::
14060::$$$message_0111_0034_0001$$$::Fuji-nee was weird, and Saber and Sakura are out."[lr]::
14061::$$$message_0111_0034_0002$$$::"...Could it be...[cacheimage storage=凛私服02a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服02a(近) time=300]well, never mind.[lr]::
14062::$$$message_0111_0034_0003$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 storage=凛私服04a(近) time=300]Is there anywhere else we could contact?"::
14063::$$$message_0111_0035_0000$$$::"If Illya is out, then she might be with the Fujimura Group. Since Grandpa Raiga dotes on her."::
14064::$$$message_0111_0036_0000$$$::"Hello, is this the Fujimura Group?[lr]::
14065::$$$message_0111_0036_0001$$$::This is Emiya[line len=3]"::
14066::$$$message_0111_0037_0000$$$::"...You are late by one hour and twenty minutes.[lr]::
14067::$$$message_0111_0037_0001$$$::Goodness, it took you quite a while to contact me, Shero.[lr]::
14068::$$$message_0111_0037_0002$$$::You must be inviting new trouble like you tend to do."[lr]::
14069::$$$message_0111_0037_0003$$$::"What?"::
14070::$$$message_0111_0038_0000$$$::An unfamiliar voice echoes from the speaker.[lr]::
14071::$$$message_0111_0038_0001$$$::She's super polite, yet her fluent Japanese doesn't make the listener irritated.[lr]::
14072::$$$message_0111_0038_0002$$$::...She has a pure and clear voice that is comparable to Saber's.::
14073::$$$message_0111_0039_0000$$$::"Yeah, um... This is Emiya, but am I talking to the Fujimura Group?"[lr]::
14074::$$$message_0111_0039_0001$$$::"...Mister Emiya.[lr]::
14075::$$$message_0111_0039_0002$$$::I am not a girl that does not mature.[lr]::
14076::$$$message_0111_0039_0003$$$::I have come to think that your lack of tension that is enough to shoot through the sky at times is endearing now."[lr]::
14077::$$$message_0111_0039_0004$$$::"Huh[line len=3]well, thank you."::
14078::$$$message_0111_0040_0000$$$::I can't help but become formal for some reason.[lr]::
14079::$$$message_0111_0040_0001$$$::The mysterious person on the other side of the phone ostentatiously takes a deep breath.::
14080::$$$message_0111_0041_0000$$$::"By the way, that's the Fujimura Group[line len=3]"[lr]::
14081::$$$message_0111_0041_0001$$$::"Like I said, I would not yell at you over something like this. Yes, I would never.[lr]::
14082::$$$message_0111_0041_0002$$$::You are in enemy territory, so it means that there is a possibility other mages are keeping a close eye on you. Even you understand that much, correct?"::
14083::$$$message_0111_0042_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14084::$$$message_0111_0042_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Shoot.[font italic=false][lr]::
14085::$$$message_0111_0042_0002$$$::I feel like I'm stepping on a landmine.::
14086::$$$message_0111_0043_0000$$$::"Now, there is no second time, Shero.[lr]::
14087::$$$message_0111_0043_0001$$$::Who do you think you are reporting to?"[lr]::
14088::$$$message_0111_0043_0002$$$::Some person whose name I don't even know is asking me who she is.[lr]::
14089::$$$message_0111_0043_0003$$$::"T-That is[line len=3]u-um[small]m...[rf]"::
14090::$$$message_0111_0044_0000$$$::"Yes, I am Edelfelt.[lr]::
14091::$$$message_0111_0044_0001$$$::...My word, please get ahold of yourself.[lr]::
14092::$$$message_0111_0044_0002$$$::You are participating in "Fem's Casa" as my substitute. I will not tell you to gain a great victory, but please at least keep the money on hand.[lr]::
14093::$$$message_0111_0044_0003$$$::[line len=3]I will not allow a single Euro of unnecessary expenditure."[lr]::
14094::$$$message_0111_0044_0004$$$::...Well, even if she tells me so...::
14095::$$$message_0111_0045_0000$$$::"Let me talk.[lr]::
14096::$$$message_0111_0045_0001$$$::Hello? I doubt it, but could this snobby voice be Luvia's?"[lr]::
14097::$$$message_0111_0045_0002$$$::"Wha[line len=2]is that savage voice Miss Tohsaka!?[lr]::
14098::$$$message_0111_0045_0003$$$::W-Why are you with Shero!?[lr]::
14099::$$$message_0111_0045_0004$$$::I thought you weren't interested in Monaco, so you chose Las Vegas!"::
14100::$$$message_0111_0046_0000$$$::"...[cacheimage storage=凛私服04b(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服04b(近)]I don't know what you're talking about, but of course I'd choose Vegas.[lr]::
14101::$$$message_0111_0046_0001$$$::You're talking about gambling, right? If making money is your objective, then something more business-like and American would be more like it and better than a refined Western European-style casino."::
14102::$$$message_0111_0047_0000$$$::"There, it seems like you have revealed your true colors, Miss Tohsaka.[lr]::
14103::$$$message_0111_0047_0001$$$::Always acting so graceful, aren't you? You are merely a savage. No matter how much you try to pretend, you can never hide your true self.[lr]::
14104::$$$message_0111_0047_0002$$$::It is unsuitable for someone like you to have a servant.[lr]::
14105::$$$message_0111_0047_0003$$$::If you want a familiar, then I suppose I shall give you the lizard in my garden, so please dismiss that servant right away."::
14106::$$$message_0111_0048_0000$$$::"I have no idea what you're talking about, but... You're good at Japanese.[lr]::
14107::$$$message_0111_0048_0001$$$::You were saying something like you were less interested in Japanese culture than a crumb of bread, but what brought that onto you?"::
14108::$$$message_0111_0049_0000$$$::"Something magically came upon me. I said there is no strong reason...![lr]::
14109::$$$message_0111_0049_0001$$$::...Goodness, I cannot believe you brought up something from two years ago.[lr]::
14110::$$$message_0111_0049_0002$$$::I shall commend you. It is very much like you to not lose your maliciousness even during a time like this."::
14111::$$$message_0111_0050_0000$$$::The two go at each other.[lr]::
14112::$$$message_0111_0050_0001$$$::It doesn't have anything to do with me, but I wonder why I feel oddly uneasy.::
14113::$$$message_0111_0051_0000$$$::"So. Why are you with Shero... I mean, Mr. Emiya?[lr]::
14114::$$$message_0111_0051_0001$$$::...I do not like it at all."::
14115::$$$message_0111_0052_0000$$$::"That is my line, Luviagelita Edelfelt.[lr]::
14116::$$$message_0111_0052_0001$$$::Why do you know Emiya? I haven't introduced you to each other, right?[lr]::
14117::$$$message_0111_0052_0002$$$::...Also, whose nickname is Shero?"::
14118::$$$message_0111_0053_0000$$$::A moment of silence.[lr]::
14119::$$$message_0111_0053_0001$$$::The unknown caller sounded like she let out a groan like she had a heart attack.::
14120::$$$message_0111_0054_0000$$$::"A-A-A-Are you still talking about that!?[lr]::
14121::$$$message_0111_0054_0001$$$::How could you, Miss Tohsaka...!? I thought we shook hands and agreed to forget about it...![lr]::
14122::$$$message_0111_0054_0002$$$::Yes, I admit that you did not mean any harm, but why do I have to receive the nickname "Mary of July" from jumping off the Tower of London holding hands with you...!?"::
14123::$$$message_0111_0055_0000$$$::"Ugh, I want to rewind time if I could![lr]::
14124::$$$message_0111_0055_0001$$$::[se volume=60 storage=se122.wav]Why did I entrust the masterpiece that I wrote to someone like you, I'm so[cacheimage storage=携帯電話01c][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01c][lquake storage=携帯電話01c vmax=8 hmax=8] stupid, stupid, [se volume=60 storage=se326.wav]stupid...!"[wvs][se volume=60 storage=se123.wav]::
14125::$$$message_0111_0056_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14126::$$$message_0111_0056_0001$$$::On the other side of the phone, I hear shooting sounds.[lr]::
14127::$$$message_0111_0056_0002$$$::The pistol-like sounds are a Gandr.[lr]::
14128::$$$message_0111_0056_0003$$$::There's no doubt about it. I speak from experience.::
14129::$$$message_0111_0057_0000$$$::"Fine, Miss Tohsaka, if that's how you're going to be, I shall accept the challenge...![lr]::
14130::$$$message_0111_0057_0001$$$::I was planning to stand by until the casino owner appears, but I shall head over there right away. [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01e][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01e]Make sure you do not trouble Mr. Emiya by being unreasonable![lr]::
14131::$$$message_0111_0057_0002$$$::Oh, you were also being called "Poppins of July" too, so our reputation in the department is even."::
14132::$$$message_0111_0058_0000$$$::She hangs up.[lr]::
14133::$$$message_0111_0058_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...What was that about?[font italic=false][lr]::
14134::$$$message_0111_0058_0002$$$::It seems like Tohsaka knew, but I don't have any recollection.[lr]::
14135::$$$message_0111_0058_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Why is she with the Fujimura Group?[font italic=false]::
14136::$$$message_0111_0059_0000$$$::"...Hmm. I'm starting to get it."[lr]::
14137::$$$message_0111_0059_0001$$$::"Tohsaka. It's great that you're getting it, but we only have one more person we can call for help."[lr]::
14138::$$$message_0111_0059_0002$$$::All that's left is Sakura's house. Shinji might be there even if Sakura isn't, and I guess it would be my first choice.::
14139::$$$message_0111_0060_0000$$$::"Hello? Is this the Matous?"[lr]::
14140::$$$message_0111_0060_0001$$$::"Oh? It's you, Shirou."[lr]::
14141::$$$message_0111_0060_0002$$$::...Huh? [shock vmax=10 time=300 count=-2]Whaaat? [wait canskip=0 time=500][shock vmax=25 time=600 count=-6]Whaaat!?[lr]::
14142::$$$message_0111_0060_0003$$$::This tone of voice is definitely Tohsaka herself.[lr]::
14143::$$$message_0111_0060_0004$$$::But, the Tohsaka in question is cramped up right next to me.::
14144::$$$message_0111_0061_0000$$$::"Why are you calling at such a time?[lr]::
14145::$$$message_0111_0061_0001$$$::Did you call me because you missed me after not seeing me just for some time?"[lr]::
14146::$$$message_0111_0061_0002$$$::"Uhhh, um, well..."[lr]::
14147::$$$message_0111_0061_0003$$$::This is even more strange than the last caller.::
14148::$$$message_0111_0062_0000$$$::"Hehe[line len=3]you're so cute, Emiya[heart][lr]::
14149::$$$message_0111_0062_0001$$$::You know, I actually couldn't sleep since I was wondering what you were doing."[lr]::
14150::$$$message_0111_0062_0002$$$::...This tone of voice through the phone is Tohsaka's, but this is getting out of hand.[lr]::
14151::$$$message_0111_0062_0003$$$::It's like, affectionate.[lr]::
14152::$$$message_0111_0062_0004$$$::Like a couple hugging shamelessly in public.::
14153::$$$message_0111_0063_0000$$$::"Um, hello...?[lr]::
14154::$$$message_0111_0063_0001$$$::Sorry, things seem complicated..."[lr]::
14155::$$$message_0111_0063_0002$$$::"Oh, are things that rough over there?[lr]::
14156::$$$message_0111_0063_0003$$$::You really are a troubled person.[lr]::
14157::$$$message_0111_0063_0004$$$::You always come to me for help when you're in a pinch[heart]"::
14158::$$$message_0111_0064_0000$$$::Her sweet voice is like she's lost her mind[line len=2]no[line len=2]she's making me lose my mind.[lr]::
14159::$$$message_0111_0064_0001$$$::And the infuriated Tohsaka that's right there.[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01a]::
14160::$$$message_0111_0065_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka, what's going on?[lr]::
14161::$$$message_0111_0065_0001$$$::I feel like I'm calling some hopelessly different place..."[lr]::
14162::$$$message_0111_0065_0002$$$::I cover the cell phone and ask the Tohsaka in front of me.::
14163::$$$message_0111_0066_0000$$$::"...Hm. I can't believe it, but it seems like when you call from this box, it calls an entirely different place.[lr]::
14164::$$$message_0111_0066_0001$$$::It's a treasure box that was made to accommodate Zelretch's 2nd True Magic that goes back and forth between parallel universes. It isn't strange for something like this to happen."::
14165::$$$message_0111_0067_0000$$$::"Hmm, I see[line len=3]that's not good."[lr]::
14166::$$$message_0111_0067_0001$$$::Even if we call for help to a parallel dimension, only that mage, Wizard Marshall Zelretch, can come over here.[lr]::
14167::$$$message_0111_0067_0002$$$::Fuji-nee, that girl from earlier, and this other Tohsaka won't help at all.[lr]::
14168::$$$message_0111_0067_0003$$$::They won't, yet she keeps talking without regard over the phone.::
14169::$$$message_0111_0068_0000$$$::"Fine, I'll go over there right away.[lr]::
14170::$$$message_0111_0068_0001$$$::Are you ready?[lr]::
14171::$$$message_0111_0068_0002$$$::I'll listen to anything you say, my Emiya[heart]"::
14172::$$$message_0111_0069_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14173::$$$message_0111_0069_0001$$$::She's as sweet as honey.[lr]::
14174::$$$message_0111_0069_0002$$$::She seems to be kissing the phone.::
14175::$$$message_0111_0070_0000$$$::"Ha, haha. Hahahaha."[lr]::
14176::$$$message_0111_0070_0001$$$::"...What are you laughing at? Give me that."[lr]::
14177::$$$message_0111_0070_0002$$$::"No. You probably shouldn't."[lr]::
14178::$$$message_0111_0070_0003$$$::You two aren't supposed to face each other.[lr]::
14179::$$$message_0111_0070_0004$$$::Just like gasoline and a torch.::
14180::$$$message_0111_0071_0000$$$::"I don't care![lr]::
14181::$$$message_0111_0071_0001$$$::I've been getting a lot of goosebumps for some reason![lr]::
14182::$$$message_0111_0071_0002$$$::I don't know who answered, but that girl makes me oddly irritated."[lr]::
14183::$$$message_0111_0071_0003$$$::"W[line len=3]What was that girl's voice!?[lr]::
14184::$$$message_0111_0071_0004$$$::Hey Shirou, what are you doing!?"::
14185::$$$message_0111_0072_0000$$$::[line len=3]I have a feeling this will be pure chaos.[lr]::
14186::$$$message_0111_0072_0001$$$::And it's Tohsaka vs. Tohsaka from a different dimension. [font italic=true]What the hell?[font italic=false][lr]::
14187::$$$message_0111_0072_0002$$$::...Ugh, I want to cover my ears and curl myself up.::
14188::$$$message_0111_0073_0000$$$::"Hello? Is this Sakura?"[lr]::
14189::$$$message_0111_0073_0001$$$::That idea is slightly terrifying, Miss Tohsaka.[lr]::
14190::$$$message_0111_0073_0002$$$::Please refrain from making statements that would make her feel small from the get-go.::
14191::$$$message_0111_0074_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Sakura?[lr]::
14192::$$$message_0111_0074_0001$$$::Don't say something so ridiculous, who are you?"[lr]::
14193::$$$message_0111_0074_0002$$$::"Who[line len=3]"::
14194::$$$message_0111_0075_0000$$$::"Oh, okay. I see, [wvl][move textoff=0 time=100 path=(430,203,255)(430,242,255)(430,225,255) storage=携帯電話01e accel=0]has a homewrecker appeared?[lr]::
14195::$$$message_0111_0075_0001$$$::No wonder Emiya is troubled, did he get captured by a bitch that threatened him to break up with me?"::
14196::$$$message_0111_0076_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=3][cacheimage storage=凛私服07c髪a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=凛私服07c髪a(近)]you're the one who's talking like a nymphomaniac, and it's giving me secondhand embarrassment!"::
14197::$$$message_0111_0077_0000$$$::...Tohsaka is snapping at Tohsaka.[lr]::
14198::$$$message_0111_0077_0001$$$::I don't know whether it's salvation or a calamity that neither of them have realized who the other person is. ::
14199::$$$message_0111_0078_0000$$$::"I don't know who or what you are, but a gushy girl like you doesn't suit Emiya.[lr]::
14200::$$$message_0111_0078_0001$$$::What this blockhead needs is a partner who will experience hardships alongside him but will warn him when he's getting off track... Yes, only an overachiever who has the qualities of a class president."::
14201::$$$message_0111_0079_0000$$$::"Understood? That means he shouldn't have anything to do with a girl whose brain has melted away.[lr]::
14202::$$$message_0111_0079_0001$$$::If you understand that, hang up the phone already, and go think about your life choices at a convent somewhere...!"::
14203::$$$message_0111_0080_0000$$$::"...Tohsaka."[lr]::
14204::$$$message_0111_0080_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Isn't it too early for her to be going out of control?[font italic=false][lr]::
14205::$$$message_0111_0080_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Wait, do you two understand instinctively that you're talking to yourselves?[font italic=false]::
14206::$$$message_0111_0081_0000$$$::"...I'm disgusted. I thought you would have some good points as someone who Emiya trusted even if he made a mistake, but I guess I was wrong.[lr]::
14207::$$$message_0111_0081_0001$$$::Qualities of a class president? [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01e][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01e]Experience hardships together?[lr]::
14208::$$$message_0111_0081_0002$$$::You're the one who doesn't understand, young lady. There's no way he can mend his ways with that little resolution...!"::
14209::$$$message_0111_0082_0000$$$::"Listen, even I've had my hands full with him for years, and I'm a hardcore straight-laced person.[lr]::
14210::$$$message_0111_0082_0001$$$::Have you ever forged a sword before? It'll only harden if you're only strict with it; you need to treat it like candy or else you won't have a flexible blade. It's the same as that.[lr]::
14211::$$$message_0111_0082_0002$$$::Get it? Your way of thinking is old. Really old. It's as if I'm looking at myself from around three years ago and it's pissing me off, [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01e][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01e][move textoff=0 time=100 path=(430,203,255)(430,242,255)(430,225,255)(430,203,255)(430,242,255)(430,225,255) storage=携帯電話01e accel=0]teeheehee!"::
14212::$$$message_0111_0083_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14213::$$$message_0111_0083_0001$$$::...God. Am I going to do something bad in the future?::
14214::$$$message_0111_0084_0000$$$::"Guh...!"[lr]::
14215::$$$message_0111_0084_0001$$$::H-Heh, you can say whatever you want, you middle-aged woman.[lr]::
14216::$$$message_0111_0084_0002$$$::You must've caught him with some dirty honeytrap, didn't you? Shirou is such a pushover being caught by a woman like that.[lr]::
14217::$$$message_0111_0084_0003$$$::Yes, I'm going to punish him later...!"::
14218::$$$message_0111_0085_0000$$$::"Wait a minute.[lr]::
14219::$$$message_0111_0085_0001$$$::I don't care what you say to me, but talking bad about Shirou is wrong.[lr]::
14220::$$$message_0111_0085_0002$$$::Besides, it seems like he's there too. I won't forgive you if you hurt him just because I lost an argument.[lr]::
14221::$$$message_0111_0085_0003$$$::...Listen, if you hurt my Emiya, I'll hunt you down and kill you no matter where you hide."::
14222::$$$message_0111_0086_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14223::$$$message_0111_0086_0001$$$::Her plentiful love hurts.[lr]::
14224::$$$message_0111_0086_0002$$$::[font italic=true]What is this, what happened, me in another world?[font italic=false][lr]::
14225::$$$message_0111_0086_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Why and how did I manage to steal Rin Tohsaka's heart...!?[font italic=false]::
14226::$$$message_0111_0087_0000$$$::"H-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]How dare you, that sounded so [wvl canskip=0 time=300]genuine just now.[lr]::
14227::$$$message_0111_0087_0001$$$::...I'll acknowledge your love, but you're directing it towards the wrong person, or do you just have bad taste?[lr]::
14228::$$$message_0111_0087_0002$$$::A blockhead like Shirou Emiya is an idealistic good-for-nothing that doesn't understand the inner workings of a woman's mind. Seriously, I wonder how you can fall that much for him."::
14229::$$$message_0111_0088_0000$$$::I want to raise my voice in objection, but I keep quiet since I'll probably be kicked if I interrupt.::
14230::$$$message_0111_0089_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
14231::$$$message_0111_0089_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...Oh?[font italic=false][lr]::
14232::$$$message_0111_0089_0002$$$::The Tohsaka on the other end goes quiet.[lr]::
14233::$$$message_0111_0089_0003$$$::Even though this Tohsaka seemed to be losing.::
14234::$$$message_0111_0090_0000$$$::"...Hey. Why are you shutting up? Say something."[lr]::
14235::$$$message_0111_0090_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14236::$$$message_0111_0090_0002$$$::There's no answer.[lr]::
14237::$$$message_0111_0090_0003$$$::The Tohsaka on the other end laughs ever so slightly like she's having fun.::
14238::$$$message_0111_0091_0000$$$::"H-Heh, I knew you didn't like him that much.[lr]::
14239::$$$message_0111_0091_0001$$$::You must also think that he's a good-for-nothing[line len=2]"[lr]::
14240::$$$message_0111_0091_0002$$$::"[line len=3]Yes. I love even that part of him."[lr]::
14241::$$$message_0111_0091_0003$$$::Just from those words, [sestop time=3000 nowait=true]this Tohsaka's mind gets jumbled.::
14242::$$$message_0111_0092_0000$$$::"Wha, wha[line len=2]"[lr]::
14243::$$$message_0111_0092_0001$$$::"Yes, how he's a blockhead, thick-headed, clumsy and says whatever's on his mind, idealistic like a kid, takes no notice to his wounds, all of it.[lr]::
14244::$$$message_0111_0092_0002$$$::You should become honest. That line sounded like you can't help but love that part of him."::
14245::$$$message_0111_0093_0000$$$::"Hey...![lr]::
14246::$$$message_0111_0093_0001$$$::Don't be ridiculous, I seriously hate that part of him[line len=2]"::
14247::$$$message_0111_0094_0000$$$::"Okay, okay, sure.[lr]::
14248::$$$message_0111_0094_0001$$$::But young lady, I don't plan to experience hardships with him. I'll watch over him struggling by his side, lend him a helping hand at the right time, and only receive the best parts.[lr]::
14249::$$$message_0111_0094_0002$$$::If I'm making a declaration, instead of being happy together, [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01e][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01e]I'll [cacheimage storage=携帯電話01b][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01b]make him happier than anyone else ever will, no questions asked."::
14250::$$$message_0111_0095_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=3][cacheimage storage=凛私服07c髪a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服07c髪a(近)]I-I've known that for a long time... N-No, I don't plan to deal with something that bothersome![lr]::
14251::$$$message_0111_0095_0001$$$::T-T-Too bad, I'll accept your excuse, but unfortunately, I don't think Emiya is someone worth doing that much for[line len=3]"::
14252::$$$message_0111_0096_0000$$$::"Really? Then I'll do as I please.[lr]::
14253::$$$message_0111_0096_0001$$$::Even if he's only worth that much for you, he's the best partner for me.[lr]::
14254::$$$message_0111_0096_0002$$$::Right, Shirou? Our love is mutual; nothing is embarrassing.[lr]::
14255::$$$message_0111_0096_0003$$$::[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=携帯電話01e][move textoff=0 time=100 path=(430,203,255)(430,242,255)(430,225,255)(430,203,255)(430,242,255)(430,225,255) storage=携帯電話01e accel=0]So, give me a kiss as my reward please[heart]"::
14256::$$$message_0111_0097_0000$$$::"Fine, go ahead and have this guy all you want![lr]::
14257::$$$message_0111_0097_0001$$$::Love is mutual and best partner my ass![lr]::
14258::$$$message_0111_0097_0002$$$::If you're with this pushover, all you'll get is trouble![lr]::
14259::$$$message_0111_0097_0003$$$::Whatever, a champion of justice and a prince riding a white horse are [font italic=true]all[font italic=false] phantoms! You can just die holding onto those ideals...!"::
14260::$$$message_0111_0098_0000$$$::...Now she's gone and done it...[lr]::
14261::$$$message_0111_0098_0001$$$::Either her Magic Crest got activated from her heightened emotions, or it was from simple arm strength...[lr]::
14262::$$$message_0111_0098_0002$$$::Either way, her cell phone brilliantly turns into junk in an instant.::
14263::$$$message_0111_0099_0000$$$::"...Heh. Cell phones are quite fragile."[lr]::
14264::$$$message_0111_0099_0001$$$::"That is... Never mind."[lr]::
14265::$$$message_0111_0099_0002$$$::Our hope of calling for rescue has been ruined, but it would've been better than it lasting until the battery died.::
14266::$$$message_0111_0100_0000$$$::"Well, that proved that this is useless so it's not regrettable, but... That woman got on my nerves.[lr]::
14267::$$$message_0111_0100_0001$$$::Emiya, do you know her?"::
14268::$$$message_0111_0101_0000$$$::"No. I don't even know what she looks like."[lr]::
14269::$$$message_0111_0101_0001$$$::Although I could endlessly imagine her face realistically.::
14270::$$$message_0111_0102_0000$$$::"...Then that's fine.[lr]::
14271::$$$message_0111_0102_0001$$$::The one that got caught was that Emiya, but be careful from now on.[lr]::
14272::$$$message_0111_0102_0002$$$::That woman was a powerful enemy[line len=2]no[line len=2]a nemesis for you."[lr]::
14273::$$$message_0111_0102_0003$$$::"...I see. Got it, I'll keep it in mind."[lr]::
14274::$$$message_0111_0102_0004$$$::I nod, overfilled with many emotions.::
14275::$$$message_0111_0103_0000$$$::"Good. You're quite obedient, Emiya."[lr]::
14276::$$$message_0111_0103_0001$$$::Of course I'd be enthusiastic about it.[lr]::
14277::$$$message_0111_0103_0002$$$::It's a warning from herself.::
14278::$$$message_0111_0104_0000$$$::"But... We're back to square one now.[lr]::
14279::$$$message_0111_0104_0001$$$::It's not possible to call for help using a cell phone..."[lr]::
14280::$$$message_0111_0104_0002$$$::"There's no use in depending on something useless.[lr]::
14281::$$$message_0111_0104_0003$$$::There should still be other ways. Let's rack our brains together."::
14282::$$$message_0111_0105_0000$$$::I feel like there's some panic in her suggestion.[lr]::
14283::$$$message_0111_0105_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
14284::$$$message_0111_0105_0002$$$::She groans at our cornered situation.[lr]::
14285::$$$message_0111_0105_0003$$$::We're in a confined, yet wide locked room.[lr]::
14286::$$$message_0111_0105_0004$$$::Tohsaka and I both cradle our heads, wondering what we should do.::9�